7:5 SMP707 `@classmethod` over `@property` stopped returning the value in Python 3.13, so `kind` reads as a bound method; use a class-level attribute or a metaclass property
12:5 SMP707 `@classmethod` over `@cached_property` stopped returning the value in Python 3.13, so `cached_kind` reads as a bound method; use a class-level attribute or a metaclass property
17:5 SMP707 `@property` calls `size` with the instance, which `@staticmethod` does not accept, so reading it raises `TypeError`; drop `@staticmethod`
22:5 SMP707 `@cached_property` calls `total` with the instance, which `@classmethod` does not accept, so reading it raises `TypeError`; drop `@classmethod`
